00035Fr 1               
00035Fr 1               ; OP_DVI ($33) — signed integer divide (truncate toward zero)
00035Fr 1               op_DVI:
00035Fr 1  20 rr rr             jsr     pm_pop          ; b → tmp1
000362r 1  85 rr                sta     tmp1
